				<F_E_NOTES>Standard 5 gal/19 liter setup for no-boil cider.  Typically the primary fermenter is a 7.5 gal/28 l or larger plastic bucket for easy of access.  Cider is often aged in a carboy or keg.</F_E_NOTES>
